tity and security services; business process outsourcing (BPO) voice services, such as customer care, technical support, and booking assistance and payment collection services; and BPO non-voice services comprising client support through email and chat, IT helpdesk, and billing and data processing. Further, it provides its cloud-communication services to clients in the banking and financial, aviation, retail, e-commerce, logistics, healthcare, hospitality, media and entertainment, pharmaceutical, and telecom sectors. The company was incorporated in 2004 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India. Route Mobile Limited is a subsidiary of Proximus Global SA."}}